;   analysis [high]: Clears the crank flags in $5A, STARTUP_CTR and the ITS settle counter $19C7, then sets $5A.0.
;        Looks up the crank ITS timing position from tbl2D_CRANK_INJ_TIMING_TBL_275B vs coolant_temp into
