; debounce_discrete_inputs
;   analysis [high]: Three-sample debounce of IOR 1804 (brake/TCC brake/PTO/range switches) into
;        RAM_status_resistor and IOR 1802 (cruise/4WD/shift switches) into IN_1802_debounced. A bit takes its new
;        value only when the last three samples agree, otherwise it keeps the old value. With 200D.4 set, the
;        1804.0 PTO bit is masked from the samples, and old bit 0 stays set while [$0F].0 is clear.
;   OBD1 DEBOUNCE_SWITCHES (match 0.76 p2-dataref)
;   called from: run_25ms_job
