; calculate_std_transmission_gear
;   analysis [medium]: Manual-trans gear estimate: ratio = engine_speed_filtered / TRANS_OUTPUT_SPEED as 8.8 fixed
;        point (FFFF if OSS=0 or ratio>=256). Ratio bands (kw_33DD..33E7) with hysteresis bands give gear 3..0
;        (low ratio = high gear). The result goes to gear_calc_MT and trans_gear_AT only when a brake-switch bit
;        (RAM_status_resistor b1|b2) is set; TRANSMISSION_RATIO is updated when the gear is accepted or held.
;   OBD1 calculate_std_transmission_gear (match 0.99 p1-global)
;   called from: run_25ms_job
