	ldx >TRANS_OUTPUT_SPEED             ; 87D1  FE 18 B9      X = TRANS_OUTPUT_SPEED | ratio = engine_speed/OSS in 8.8 fixed point via idiv+fdiv; FFFF if OSS=0 or ratio >= 256
