;   analysis [high]: Samples the VSS pulse accumulator count and timestamp atomically into VEH_SPD_INPUT_STRUCT
;        and gets the pulse period from read_vehicle_speed_part_886E (timeout reload k_3405=7). Speed =
;        $0565(1381)*65536/period, filtered with CAL_VEH_SPEED3_FILT into vehicle_speed; it is 0 when the period
;        times out (FFFF).
