; vss_period_from_pulse_count_886E
;   analysis [high]: Pulse-period calculator on the VSS struct (+0 last count, +1/2 last time, +3 timeout, +4/5
;        period, +6/7 new time, +8 new count). With new pulses, period = dTime/dPulses and the timeout is reloaded
;        from B. With no pulses, it counts the timeout down and returns FFFF (stopped) when it reaches 0. The
;        pulse delta is kept in $1CB1 for the odometer.
