; calc_input_shaft_speed_raw_9612
;   analysis [medium]: Produces the raw input-shaft speed $18A2. If an input speed sensor exists
;        (Configuration_set_3.3 or tbl_3864.7) it is measured from TIC2 pulse count/capture through the period
