;        Uses curve tbl_TRANS_PCS_duty_curve_4585, corrected by the term (k_4584 - duty)*[$1AF5] and a fdiv
;        against curve 45A7, +0.5 rounding, clamped to $FF. Forces duty 0 when DS_TCCMODE b0/b1 are set and $1AF5
;        is 0.
