;        coolant temp window ($7E.2, $18DB), brake ($7E.3), $6B.0 ($7E.4), post-shift timer $1AE2 ($7E.5/$7F.0),
;        cold trans with tbl_457E hysteresis ($7F.2), FMEM gear ($7F.3). $7C.0 = any reason set. A force-motor ad
;   called from: TCC_control_50ms_DD5F
