; calc_shift_request_E4B2
;   analysis [medium]: Shift-pattern evaluation (50 ms). Upshift test uses the pointer table at ptrtab_E3B4:
;        forced request $1ABA[gear] / PRNDL override / kickdown pattern (EB47) / normal pattern (EAF1). Downshift
;        test uses the table at $E3C0, with forced request $1ABD[gear-1]. Reason bits go to $78 (lo nibble up, hi
;        nibble down). Upshift needs VSS >= the threshold returned in A. The gear limit from d_7F11 ($85.1) can b
;   called from: run_50ms_job
