;        then sub_6A3F with ANTISTALL_DASHPOT_TMR, then averages it 50/50 into BKUP_MEAS_INJ_TIMING.
;   OBD1 GET_BACKUP_MEAS_INJ_TMG (match 0.99 p1-global): Calculate backup mode CKP signal
;   Trigger = CMP interrupt
